    <text>
        <body>
        <div facs="#eSc_textblock_d59aeee7" type="illustration">
            <figure>
                <desc>A woman in an evening gown stands between dark curtains at a tall window, looking out at a terrace with a grand piano and guests</desc>
            </figure>
        </div>

        <div facs="#eSc_textblock_f14f8ddd">
            <head>
                <lb />
                <quote type="testimonial">
                    "Unbelievably True to the Artist's Playing—
                    <hi rendition="#right"><lb /><hi rendition="#i">That's why I bought it</hi>"</hi>
                </quote>
            </head>
        </div>
        <div facs="#eSc_textblock_03db0457">
            <p>
                <lb />
                <hi rendition="#k">
                    <hi rendition="#larger">T</hi>he
                </hi>
                infinite joy and satisfaction that attend the
                <lb />possession of a thing which is the best of its
                <lb />kind go with the purchase of the
                <name type="brand">
                    Welte-Mignon
                    <lb />Licensee
                    Reproducing Piano
                </name>.
                It brings you the world's
                <lb />finest music,
                <seg xml:id="topic_1" ana="#personality" type="topic" resp="#np">
                    played with all the tone-color, the fire, the
                    <lb />verve, the <hi rendition="#i">personality</hi> of the great pianists.
                </seg>
                You have but
            </p>
        </div>
        <div facs="#eSc_textblock_5abd2d51">
            <p>
                <lb />to hear it to realize that
                <seg xml:id="topic_2" ana="#exact_reproduction" resp="#np" type="topic">
                    <hi rendition="#i">its playing is the artist's playing.</hi>
                </seg>
                <lb /><hi rendition="#et">Your piano merchant will be proud to give you a</hi>
                <lb />demonstration any time.
                <name type="brand">
                    Welte-Mignon Licensee
                    <lb />Reproducing
                    Pianos
                </name> are offered by 115 leading piano
                <lb />manufacturers.
                <orgName>
                    The Auto Pneumatic Action
                    Company
                </orgName>,
                <lb />
                <persName>W. C. Heaton, <hi rendition="#i">President</hi></persName>,
                <address><addrLine>653 West 51st Street, New York.</addrLine></address>
            </p>
        </div>

        <div facs="#eSc_textblock_5837879e" type="brand-elements">
            <ab><hi rendition="#c">
                <name type="brand">
                    <hi rendition="#in"><lb />Welte-Mignon</hi>
                    <hi rendition="#i #k #g #smaller"><hi rendition="#smaller"><hi rendition="#smaller"><lb />Licensee</hi></hi></hi>
                    <lb />Reproducing Piano
                </name>
            </hi></ab>
        </div>

        <div facs="#eSc_textblock_b603b3c0">
            <ab><seg type="slogan">
                <hi rendition="#k #g #c">
                    <lb />The Master's Fingers on Your Piano
                </hi>
            </seg></ab>
        </div>

        <div facs="#eSc_textblock_dbdcd861" type="illustration">
            <figure type="logo">
                <desc>Phantom hands on a keyboard.</desc>
            </figure>
        </div>
